         "title": "Chaos In Washington As Parents Struggle To Find Doctors To Complete “Biological Sex” Exams",
         "uri": "https://www.erininthemorning.com/p/chaos-in-washington-as-parents-struggle"
        }
       },
       "langs": [
        "en"
       ],
       "text": "It’s chaos in Washington. To play sports, every girl now needs a doctor to sign off on her “biological sex.”\n\nThe deadline is Dec. 3. It's Thanksgiving, Doctors are on vacation.\n\nThe season’s already underway.\n\nSupporters are upset, feel they weren't warned.\n\nSubscribe to support our journalism."
      },
